              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.1+EXO.26.2+EXO.26.3+EXO.26.4+EXO.26.5+EXO.26.6+EXO.26.7+EXO.26.8+EXO.26.9+EXO.26.10+EXO.26.11+EXO.26.12+EXO.26.13+EXO.26.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 26:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese w’umuhinga mu bakora ico gikorwa, akora iryo hema ry’imbere, barisakaza impuzu cumi; izo mpuzu zajishwe mu nyuzi zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza, no mu nyuzi z’amasufe no mu z’amashigisha no mu zisa n’ agahama; kandi zari zijishwekw ibishushanyo vy’abakerubi, bijishwe n’abahinga bavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburebure bg’impuzu yose bgar’ amatambge mirongwibiri n’umunani y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubgaguke bgayo bgar’ amatambge ane: impuzu zose zari cabugerwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besaleli arōngōranya impuzu zitanu ukwazo, zindi zitanu azirōngōranya ukwazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atēra utugombo tw’udutambara tw’amasufe ku ruhande rumwe rw’impuzu iherera izārōngōranijwe za mbere, atēra n’utundi tugombo nk’utwo ku ruhande rw’impuzu iherera izindi mu zārōngōranijwe za kabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utwo tugombo yatēye ku mpuzu imwe twari mirongwitanu, no mu zindi za kabiri zārōngōranijwe, atēra utundi mirongwitanu nyene ku ruhande rw’iherera izindi; utwo tugombo twari dutumberanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acura uturinda mirongwitanu mw izahabu, adufatanisha izo mpuzu zārōngōranijwe: nukw iryo hema ry’imbere ricika rimwe ryiramvuriye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
