          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.31+EXO.26.32+EXO.26.33+EXO.26.34+EXO.26.35+EXO.26.36+EXO.26.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 26:31-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajisha igihuzu co gukingīra, akijisha mu nyuzi z’amasufe no mu z’amashigisha no mu zisa n’ agahama, no mu zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza; kandi cari kijishwekw ibishushanyo vy’abekerubi, bijishwe n’abahinga bavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akibāzira inkingi zine mu giti c’umushita, azomekakw izahabu, azitērakw imisumari yacuzwe mw izahabu; avugutira ifeza, ayikūramw’ ibitereko bine vyo kuzinegamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ajisha igihuzu co gukinga ku muryango w’ ihema, mu nyuzi z’amasufe no mu z’amashigisha no mu zisa n’agahama, no mu zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza, cari kijererenzwekw amabara n’abahinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abāza inkingi zitanu zaco, azitērakw imisumari; ku mitwe yazo azomekakw izahabu, bo n’ imitambikwa yazo; ibitereko vyazo ukw ari bitanu vyari bicuzwe mu miringa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
